{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unwind with the satisfying art of balance! In Steady Store, enjoy a peaceful puzzle experience where you arrange weighted items and discover helpful modifiers to create perfect harmony between two inventory grids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2696\ufe0f <strong>Simple Weight Balancing</strong> - Each item has an easy-to-see weight value - just make both sides equal for that satisfying &quot;click&quot; of perfect balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 <strong>Helpful Modifier Slots</strong> - Discover  modifiers that make puzzles easier to solve: double an item's weight, make heavy things lighter, or spread weight around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Relaxing Progression</strong> - Take your time with 48 gently escalating puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>No Pressure Gameplay</strong> - No timers, no penalties - just pure puzzle satisfaction at your own pace. Restart as many times as you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Multiple Ways to Win</strong> - Stuck? There's usually more than one way to solve each puzzle - find the approach that works for you. Use hints if needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Clean, Soothing Design</strong> - Enjoy a calming visual experience with gentle colors and smooth animations.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3999580?t=1758596447","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999580/3975c8fc1254f7b7fd5689dd26a72eac5fb64af5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758596447","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999580/97a106dbc0ad6a25a3f0feed586d1f34e96be224/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758596447","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999580/97a106dbc0ad6a25a3f0fe